---
# These are vendored Google SafeSide sources (github.com/google/safeside),
# kept as close to upstream as possible so they can be re-synced. gem5's
# clang-format hook runs with --style=file and walks up from each file, so
# this pins the tree to upstream's own Google style: without it, touching a
# single line inside a function reformats the whole function to gem5 style
# and buries the real change in hundreds of lines of noise.
BasedOnStyle: Google
